@ 35.1.12 - Proto-Central Salish to Pentlatch
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Galloway, Brent (1982), “Proto-Central Salish Phonology and Sound Correspondences”. From the 17th International Conference on Salish and Neighboring Languages
